Dear Mennatullah Siam:


The VISTA Postdoctoral Fellowship Adjudication committee met to review appl=
ications submitted for the Spring 2021 VISTA Postdoctoral Fellowship compet=
ition. We are pleased to inform you that you have been awarded a VISTA Post=
doctoral Fellowship of $55,000 per year for two years. This award also incl=
udes an annual research allowance of $7,500 plus $1,000 in networking funds=
.


Please note that this fellowship requires acceptance with a start date no l=
ater than December 31, 2021. Please communicate your intention to accept or=
 decline the fellowship by September 1, 2021, to applyvista@yorku.ca<mailto=
:applyvista@yorku.ca>.


A formal letter of offer containing relevant details will follow this e-mai=
l. If you have any questions about the fellowship or the offer, please don'=
t hesitate to contact Kim McIntyre, Postdoctoral Services Coordinator, by e=
-mail at kimmcint@yorku.ca<mailto:kimmcint@yorku.ca>. You may also contact =
Linda Moradzadeh, Operations Manager in the VISTA Admin Office at applyvist=
a@yorku.ca<mailto:applyvista@yorku.ca>.


Congratulations and best wishes for a successful fellowship!


Sincerely,
 [cid:77f2621d-2ee1-4a84-9b30-6d9b3ff2cf53]
